# No container rebuilds

Do not rebuild or restart Docker containers at any point. Other agents edit this repo in parallel, and an incomplete tree will crash the build.

This overrides the rebuild step in the Docker-only rule and any general instruction to verify by running the app.

- Implement the change, then stop.
- Report what you changed. Ask the user to rebuild from the repo root with `docker compose up -d --build`, inspect the result, and request corrections if needed.
- Do not run `docker compose up`, `docker compose build`, `docker compose restart`, `docker build`, or any other image or container rebuild yourself.
- Checks that do not start or rebuild containers (unit tests, static review) are still fine when they fit the task.
